1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:52,040
3 years later

25
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,640
Senior,

26
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,360
I’m leaving seclusion.

27
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,600
You don't have to worry,

28
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,790
I have memorized the Underworld Ascension Method

29
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:03,630
and the technique to locate extreme Yin energy gathering spots.

30
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:05,990
I will find a suitable place to cultivate.

31
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,400
I’m sorry for dragging you into this.

32
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,630
When you helped me,

33
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,350
you used too much of your Origin Soul's energy.

34
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:15,480
If you hadn't, you wouldn't be in this state.

35
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,200
I will form my Golden Core.

36
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:17,830
Wait for me.

37
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,160
You will wake up,

38
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,000
right ?

39
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:35,790
It's been 100 years...

40
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:38,670
Master...

41
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:42,190
you abandoned your corpse last time.

42
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,390
But this time,

43
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,470
you won’t escape !

44
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,640
Zi Daren\NWu Yu's Corpse Puppet\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul

45
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,040
The Yin energy is dense here.

46
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,520
Village ruins

47
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,390
Steamed buns for sale !

48
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,080
Scram !

49
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,000
It was destroyed in a single night

50
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:54,940
and an extreme Yin energy gathering spot was created by these countless deaths...

51
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:56,120
Grade 1\NUnderworld Yin

52
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:21,880
The maze formation is complete.

53
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:39,510
The Underworld Ascension Method has 9 layers.

54
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,630
Every 3 layers requires you

55
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:46,110
to open the meridians for the Dantian, Qi Sea, and the ancestral meridian.

56
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,640
This is called meridian awakening.

57
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,430
The success rate of meridian awakening

58
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:53,550
is heavily influenced by the quality of the Yin energy.

59
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,470
When a meridian awakening succeeds,

60
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,360
a Cold Core will be condensed.

61
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,800
With that Cold Core,

62
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,830
your spiritual energy will become cold spiritual energy.

63
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,270
Finally, by merging the 3 Cold Cores,

64
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:09,550
you will have a chance to reach Core Formation directly.

65
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:27,520
Adai\NLate stage Foundation Establishment

66
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,880
Who dares to trespass ?

67
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,680
Still not leaving ?

68
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,560
You're courting death !

69
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:27,950
Shit !

70
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,360
I can’t retrieve it...

71
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,000
What kind of technique is this ?

72
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:56,040
Its healing effect is extraordinary...

73
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,960
Who are you ?

74
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,550
If you leave now

75
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,440
and stop interrupting my cultivation,

76
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,110
I’ll let this matter slide.

77
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,630
Now stay out of my way.

78
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,870
And if you don't,

79
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,070
I will destroy you.

80
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,750
You mean this formation ?

81
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:51,190
The talismans on this guy's body are weird.

82
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,670
I must avoid conflict...

83
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,520
You’re courting death !

84
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:08,720
Thousand Illusions Bead

85
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,480
This is an artifact !

86
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,790
Core Formation ?

87
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,760
This is…

88
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,760
an illusion artifact.

89
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,230
Nascent Soul !

90
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:39,080
These illusions are very realistic.

91
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:41,730
The more spiritual energy flows into the bead,

92
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,960
the higher the illusory cultivation level becomes.

93
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,800
It's difficult to see through it

94
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,070
so it's perfect

95
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:48,920
for intimidation.

96
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,310
This guy is weird

97
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,680
for trading such an artifact

98
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,670
against a minor maze formation.

99
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,240
I should find a better cultivation spot.

100
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,800
Grade 5\NUnderworld Yin

101
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:13,320
This place is different,

102
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:16,090
the Yin energy is far denser than elsewhere.

103
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,190
Begin meridian awakening !

104
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,520
Wang Lin doesn’t know that

105
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,220
his spiritual energy

106
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:37,960
is being affected by the extreme Yin conditions

107
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,280
and is slowly evolving towards the Ji Realm.

108
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,200
The main reason this is happening

109
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:46,790
is that the Underworld Ascension Method

110
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,990
is one of the rare techniques

111
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:53,830
capable of cultivating Ji Realm spiritual energy.

112
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,520
In the Underworld Ascension Method,

113
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,720
each meridian awakening gets more difficult.

114
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:26,560
I must find an even better extreme Yin energy gathering spot.

115
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,480
It's been a century,

116
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,110
I never thought you’d gain sentience.

117
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,150
I can spare you

118
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:51,760
but you will have to use your bond with Master

119
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,390
to help me locate his Nascent Soul.

120
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,230
Let’s go,

121
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,190
take me to him.

122
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,750
If you can find Master’s Nascent Soul,

123
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:04,790
I’ll devour it and gain my freedom.

124
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:08,790
And you might evolve into a Corpse Demon.

125
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,880
Grade 2\NUnderworld Yin

126
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,320
It's still Underworld Yin level...

127
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:41,000
You’ve been following me this whole time,

128
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,600
what do you want ?

129
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,960
Do you want me to follow you ?

130
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,240
This statue

131
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,710
looks like it's alive.

132
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,920
Grade 10\NUnderworld Yin

133
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,680
This extreme Yin energy gathering spot

134
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:52,480
is Grade 10 Underworld Yin !

135
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:03,960
5 days later

136
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:15,950
I have already mastered the 5th layer of the Underworld Ascension Method.

137
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:01,710
I have found you...

138
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,560
Young friend, don’t act rashly.

139
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:30,840
This old man means no harm.

140
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:45,310
Adai,

141
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:48,360
don’t be rude to our guest.

142
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,400
Wu Yu's Nascent Soul

143
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,560
Master...

144
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,430
It's been 100 years...

145
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,510
But this time,

146
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,360
you won’t escape.

147
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,630
Who is he ?

148
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,160
Are you his master ?

149
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,400
He's my Corpse Puppet.

150
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:15,110
I'm an Ancestor of the Corpse Sect of Zhao.

151
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:17,350
All disciples of the Corpse Sect

152
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,710
must find a corpse to refine into

153
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,360
their Corpse Puppet.

154
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,240
As cultivation increases,

155
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,830
the Corpse Puppet will get stronger.

156
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,000
Your Corpse Puppet rebelled ?

157
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:29,590
Yes...

158
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:33,030
300 years ago, when I came here,

159
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,430
my Corpse Puppet was influenced by the Yin energy,

160
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,950
escaped my control

161
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,350
and attacked me.

162
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,910
The other one is my former corpse

163
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,070
that has somehow gained sentience...

164
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,430
I really need your help, young friend.

165
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:52,190
I can use a secret technique

166
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,750
to open a teleportation formation

167
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:57,310
directly to the Corpse Sect.

168
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:00,760
If you can activate a teleportation formation,

169
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,680
then why are you still here ?

170
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:06,910
I must not go further than 100 li away from my corpse

171
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:06,910
Note: 1 li = 150m

172
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:08,830
or my weak Nascent Soul

173
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:11,430
might dissipate.

174
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:16,670
I beg you, find my Senior Brother Ye Zizai and ask him to rescue me.

175
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,830
Adai told me that

176
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:51,670
you cultivate with Yin energy.

177
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:54,270
The Corpse Sect has secluded cultivation caves

178
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:58,510
with Earth-level Yin energy.

179
00:17:59,080 --> 00:17:59,880
Young friend,

180
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:01,910
I’ll activate the formation now.

181
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,040
It's now up to you

182
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:07,510
to decide what you do !

183
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:10,310
The Corpse Puppet is clearly bloodthirsty...

184
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,150
If I don’t leave now,

185
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,350
I’ll be in danger

186
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:14,910
when that guy breaks in.

187
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:16,680
Agreed.

188
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:31,390
Master, this time you won’t escape !

189
00:18:41,080 --> 00:20:42,960
As you may know, Daoism is not an exact science and you don't need to understand any of the inner working of chinese internal alchemy.\N\NAll you need to know is that to reach Core Formation Wang Lin needs to absorb Yin energy, condense 3 Cold Cores and fuse them together to make a Golden Core.\N\NUnderworld Yin < Earth Yin\N\NThe Ji Realm will be explained later.\N\N"To go into seclusion" is to isolate oneself for cultivation, recover from injuries, refine artifacts, etc...\N\NFor the curious:\NThere are 3 Dantian in the body located in the head, the heart and the lower abdomen (the 3 spots mentioned by the Underworld Ascension Method but with different names). In general, the Dantian is the location where spiritual energy is stored and is where cultivation happens (where a foundation is built to house a Golden Core, a Nascent Soul, an Origin Soul, etc...).\NFeel free to dig up that rabbit hole on your own if you want.

190
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:52,200
I've been walking this path for endless years

191
00:18:49,210 --> 00:18:52,200
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

192
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:57,800
Is it the compass of fate

193
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:57,800
that wrote this outcome for us ?

194
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:03,720
The heavens want to erase your existence,

195
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:09,440
that's the obsession guiding me.

196
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:15,040
Is this the path to uncover

197
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:15,040
truths from falsehoods ?

198
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:20,640
In a world of murk and shadow,

199
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:20,640
only the flame of truth can light the way.

200
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:26,360
Look at them all,

201
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:26,360
being carried by the waves.

202
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:31,000
Look at them all,

203
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,000
being drowned.

204
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:34,320
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

205
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:37,400
I will let the world refine my soul.

206
00:19:37,530 --> 00:19:42,960
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

207
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:42,960
I will fight.

208
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:46,080
I'll break through the abyss of despair

209
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:49,120
to finally learn who I really am.

210
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:54,480
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

211
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,480
I embrace this obsession.

212
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:57,440
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

213
00:19:57,440 --> 00:20:00,240
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

214
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:05,720
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

215
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:05,720
I'll still fight.

216
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:09,080
It's hard to avoid loneliness

217
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:12,120
when you are above everyone else.

218
00:20:12,120 --> 00:20:17,800
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

219
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:17,800
be afraid of a firefly ?
